msgid "JOURNAL_GUIDE"
msgstr "OBSERVE\nOpen scan mode with {scan} and keep an animal in the crosshair until the circle fills. Previously scanned species show their values immediately.\n\nDISCOVER\nA new species awards discovery points and can unlock one of its locked body parts. Known species do not grant another reward.\n\nCREATE\nOpen the creature editor with F2 in the game to attach available parts.\n\nSURVIVE\nLeft-click to eat and drink. Your creature’s anatomy determines which food it can eat.\n\nYOUR COLLECTION\nJ opens this book. Esc closes it."

